{"schemaVersion":1,"id":42,"sections":[{"id":"116001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1410],"start":0,"count":10},{"id":"116001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11400],"start":10,"count":14},{"id":"116002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1420],"start":24,"count":19},{"id":"116002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11410],"start":43,"count":13},{"id":"116003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1430],"start":56,"count":13},{"id":"116003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11420],"start":69,"count":13}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:2","scriptId":1410,"text":"瞄了一眼后视镜，已经能看到远处的坡道上扬起了大量的沙尘。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:3","scriptId":1410,"text":"“奇怪了，难道我们被锁定了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:4","scriptId":1410,"text":"“啊？那怎么办！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:5","scriptId":1410,"text":"“如果是这样的话，那就反过来利用这一点，虽然有点危险……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:6","scriptId":1410,"text":"“什么意思？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:7","scriptId":1410,"text":"“简单点说，我们现在开始往西南方向撤退。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":115,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:8","scriptId":1410,"text":"“那就是说我们现在往偏离伏龙芝的方向撤退？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":115,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:9","scriptId":1410,"text":"“没错，这样的话我们就能确定那些战车兽是锁定了我们还是锁定了伏龙芝学院。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":115,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":127,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:10","scriptId":1410,"text":"“确定了以后呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":127,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-PROLOGUE:1410:11","scriptId":1410,"text":"“如果是锁定的我们，那么就绕路迂回；如果目标是伏龙芝的话，那么我们就从侧翼伏击骚扰敌人的行进。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":127,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:1","scriptId":11400,"text":"队伍从侧路绕道以后，果然没有受到追击，大批的战车兽从我们不远处的大道上径直通过。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":127,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:2","scriptId":11400,"text":"这点距离不用望远镜也能观察的很清楚，战车兽的规模非常庞大。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":127,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:3","scriptId":11400,"text":"“呼……终于是逃过一劫，不过情况比想象中的要麻烦不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":127,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:4","scriptId":11400,"text":"“不是已经安全了吗？怎么还会麻烦呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":115,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:5","scriptId":11400,"text":"“因为如果目标不是我们而是伏龙芝的话，那就非常不妙了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:6","scriptId":11400,"text":"“恩，芙琳说得对，如果是以我们为目标的话，迂回绕路能给教官她们争取时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:7","scriptId":11400,"text":"“但是如果目标是伏龙芝的话，时间就非常紧迫，一定要快点通知教官这个情况。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:8","scriptId":11400,"text":"说到这里我停顿了一下，咽了下口水。队员们的视线都集中在我的身上，那是等待下一步命令的目光。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:9","scriptId":11400,"text":"“长官，你倒是快说啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:10","scriptId":11400,"text":"沉不住气的佐伊打破了这短暂的沉默。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:11","scriptId":11400,"text":"“咳哼，我想你们也大概知道我下面要发布什么命令了。没错，侧翼骚扰。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:12","scriptId":11400,"text":"“我们就从一侧不停得给予战车兽群骚扰攻击，但是要注意自己的安全，不要做过头了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:13","scriptId":11400,"text":"“是！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116001-EPILOGUE:11400:14","scriptId":11400,"text":"侧翼骚扰作战启动。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:2","scriptId":1420,"text":"现在，除了射程最远的伊诺以外剩下的队员都已经离开安全位置，向着战车兽群的侧翼展开攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:3","scriptId":1420,"text":"而我则继续尝试联线索菲亚教官。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:4","scriptId":1420,"text":"“希望这次能接通。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:5","scriptId":1420,"text":"许愿般的自言自语，然而事与愿违，步话机中仍旧传来一阵“滋滋滋”的噪声。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:6","scriptId":1420,"text":"“可恶！难道我就只能在这里干看着！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:7","scriptId":1420,"text":"我抱怨般地猛拍了下步话机，发出了“呯”的一声巨响。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:8","scriptId":1420,"text":"一旁的伊诺不禁打了个冷颤。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":180,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:9","scriptId":1420,"text":"“发生了什么事情？长官。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:10","scriptId":1420,"text":"意识到自己的失态，我故作镇定的回答道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:11","scriptId":1420,"text":"“啊……没事，我这边的问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:12","scriptId":1420,"text":"收回思绪，我拿出望远镜看了看前方的战况。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:13","scriptId":1420,"text":"“佐伊她们好像冲得有点前面了，在这里进行炮击援护的话，是不是有点超过射程了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":175,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:14","scriptId":1420,"text":"“没关系，现在的位置还在可命中的范围之内。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":175,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:15","scriptId":1420,"text":"“希望能争取到一点时间……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":175,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:16","scriptId":1420,"text":"就在这时，望远镜的视野内出现了一个熟悉的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":175,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:17","scriptId":1420,"text":"♪～♪～♪～","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":48,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:18","scriptId":1420,"text":"“埃普西隆！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":48,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:19","scriptId":1420,"text":"握着望远镜的手心里开始渗出汗来，果然之前的不好预感应验了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":48,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-PROLOGUE:1420:20","scriptId":1420,"text":"“这下大事不妙！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":48,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:0","scriptId":11410,"text":"佐伊她们的战斗正在顺利的进行中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":48,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":36,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:2","scriptId":11410,"text":"“好多敌人啊，虽然每次都能引诱一点出来……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":36,"right":48,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":115,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:3","scriptId":11410,"text":"“我们这次侧翼的骚扰攻击，主要是削弱一点敌人的战斗力，毕竟全部干掉是不可能的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":36,"right":115,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":499,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:4","scriptId":11410,"text":"“现在这个位置应该已经可以了，不能再继续向前了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":499,"right":115,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":127,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:5","scriptId":11410,"text":"“目前一切正常，应该不会有什么大问题，稍微前进下也是可以的吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":499,"right":127,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":115,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:6","scriptId":11410,"text":"“站着说话不腰疼，那种数量下，要不是每次佐伊都能引来数量刚好的战车兽，我们还真不一定能一下子清理它们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":127,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":35,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:7","scriptId":11410,"text":"“那个～是我应该做的啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":35,"right":127,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:8","scriptId":11410,"text":"就在这时，通信装置里传来了指挥官的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":35,"right":127,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:9","scriptId":11410,"text":"“从现在的位置退回来！那群战车兽大队里面有埃普西隆！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":35,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:10","scriptId":11410,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:11","scriptId":11410,"text":"听到那个恐怖的名字后，佐伊的神情变得严肃了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:12","scriptId":11410,"text":"“全部后撤----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116002-EPILOGUE:11410:13","scriptId":11410,"text":"佐伊话音未落，突然一波炮弹向雨点般射了过来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:2","scriptId":1430,"text":"侧翼的战车兽集团遭到了攻击？看上去是零散的钢舞姬所为。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:3","scriptId":1430,"text":"埃普西隆的视力很好，从远处开始观察起战斗的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:4","scriptId":1430,"text":"“哦呀～这个钢舞姬我有点印象啊，之前好像在研究所遇到过。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:5","scriptId":1430,"text":"埃普西隆脸上浮现出高兴的微笑，但那绝非是善意的。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:6","scriptId":1430,"text":"这次出击是直接从奥米克戎那里收到的命令，内容则是不惜一切代价夺回样本物质。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:7","scriptId":1430,"text":"“恩，不惜一切代价的话，这次就可以玩个痛快了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:8","scriptId":1430,"text":"“那么就先从那边开始吧，反正时间还有的是～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:9","scriptId":1430,"text":"埃普西隆带着诡异的笑容开始向佐伊她们所在的方向突进。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:10","scriptId":1430,"text":"佐伊所在的位置----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:11","scriptId":1430,"text":"“埃普西隆冲过来了！好像躲不掉了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":128,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:12","scriptId":1430,"text":"“看上去很厉害的样子……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":128,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":116,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:13","scriptId":1430,"text":"“不要慌，以平常心应对，不要忙中出错！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":116,"right":128,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":500,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116003-PROLOGUE:1430:14","scriptId":1430,"text":"“那个……埃普西隆已经进入有效射程，开始攻击吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":116,"right":500,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:0","scriptId":11420,"text":"遇到埃普西隆之后，展开了一场恶战，战况非常糟糕。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":116,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:2","scriptId":11420,"text":"毕竟除了佐伊以外的人都是第一次面对这个生物，多少会有点对未知的恐惧感。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":116,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:3","scriptId":11420,"text":"“不妙啊，佐伊她们现在已经被埃普西隆慢慢逼至死角了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:4","scriptId":11420,"text":"突然灵机一闪，我猛得按下喇叭，吉普车发出了响亮的鸣笛声。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:5","scriptId":11420,"text":"“嘟！！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:6","scriptId":11420,"text":"前方----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:7","scriptId":11420,"text":"“刚才是什么声音？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:8","scriptId":11420,"text":"埃普西隆把头转向一边，寻找着声音的出处。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:9","scriptId":11420,"text":"短短几秒，她就锁定了目标。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:11","scriptId":11420,"text":"“这不是那个时候的人类吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:12","scriptId":11420,"text":"面对不同方向的两个目标，埃普西隆在脑内纠结了一会儿。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:14","scriptId":11420,"text":"“那个喇叭好吵，那就先弄死那边的吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116003-EPILOGUE:11420:15","scriptId":11420,"text":"调转枪头，埃普西隆向指挥官所在的位置直冲过去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":500,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["后方战车兽好像发现了我们","骚扰作战","埃普西隆遭遇战"]}
